<!--
  Vote rail FRAGMENT for s2script_lib.xml (workshop addon 3790153369).

  This is not a second CustomHudLayout resource. Do not point m_strLayout at this
  file. Paste the #s2_vote panel into the existing lib root (same addon), include
  s2_vote.css from that layout (or merge the CSS into the lib stylesheet), then
  republish 3790153369.

  Server JS drives these ids through hudkit.layout — the same entity as s2_m0 / s2_m1.
  Panels start without a hide class in markup: per-player hide is a class the server
  adds, not a markup class the server would have to remove.
-->
